 in Liam’s family. a b 3 Read the poster again and answer the questions. 1 Where is Liam from? 2 Where is Liam’s mom from? 3 Where is Liam’s dad from? 4 Who is James? c Liam d 5 What is Liam’s sister’s name? THINK! 1 Who is important to Liam? 2 Who in your family is important to you? PROJECT TASK 21 PLAN 1 Choose a person you admire. 2 Find out about his/her family. Find photos or draw a family tree. 22 YOUR DIGITAL PORTFOLIO 3 Write your text. Remember to include personal Upload your poster to the class portfolio for information about him/her, information about his everyone to see! Present your poster to the class. or her family, and your opinion. 23 REFLECT 4 Design your poster. 5 Check grammar, spelling, and punctuation. Which is your favorite poster? Why? 108", "page": 111, "type": "pdf_page", "knowledge": []}
