lling favorite p.33 There is/There Around the World: Intonation in place? are (Yes/No A Home on Water Yes/No and Questions and p.40 Wh- Questions 3.1 Short Answers) p.42 Where Do You p.39 3.2 Live? Homes Can Be Different 4 Family p.44 Verb to have Video Presentation: Conversation Describing a An Email: What is (Affirmative) Our Families p.46 Between Family Photo* Description of family? Family Adjectives p.48 p.47 Teenagers a Family p.52 Matters Pronunciation: Why is family Verb to have: I, Describing ’s Endings important? p.43 you, we, they Math: The Saraíba their Families (Negative, Family Poster p.50 p.48 Yes/No Questions, and 4.2 4.1 Short Answers) Families Around the Family Time p.49 World Review p.53 1.1 VIDEO AROUND THE WORLD ACROSS THE CURRICULUM 4 CONTENTS", "page": 7, "type": "pdf_page", "knowledge": []}
